{"raB":[{"id":"raB","headword":"रभ्","headword_slp1":"raB","senses_r":[{"n":1,"spans":[{"t":"txt","s":"रभ् (originally = ग्रभ्, लभ्), i. 1, Ātm. (in epic poetry and Man. also Par., "},{"t":"cite","s":"Man. 7, 59","q":"Man"},{"t":"txt","s":").\n 1. † To desire vehemently.\n 2. † To act inconsiderately.\n 3. To seize, to take (ved.).\n --With the prep. आ आ, To begin, "},{"t":"cite","s":"Man. 7, 299","q":"Man"},{"t":"txt","s":". []\n 2. To act strenuously, Bhaṭṭ. 3, 7.\n --Ptcple. of the pf. pass. आरब्ध.\n 1. Began, done; रहस्य् आरब्धा कथा, A secret conversation, Vikr. d. 51.\n 2. Having begun, "},{"t":"cite","s":"MBh. 1, 7660","q":"MBh"},{"t":"txt","s":".\n --Absol. आरभ्य, From. "},{"t":"cite","s":"Hit. 91, 21","q":"Hit"},{"t":"txt","s":".\n --With अन्वा अनु-आ, To get back, "},{"t":"cite","s":"Rām. 2, 64, 60","q":"Rām"},{"t":"txt","s":".\n --With अभ्या अभि-आ, To begin, "},{"t":"cite","s":"MBh. 3, 10724","q":"MBh"},{"t":"txt","s":" (Par.).\n --With प्रा प्र-आ, To begin, "},{"t":"cite","s":"Bhag. 18, 15","q":"Bhag"},{"t":"txt","s":"; Pañc. iii. d. 130. प्रारब्ध, n. An attempt, enterprise, "},{"t":"cite","s":"Lass. 1, 6","q":"Lass"},{"t":"txt","s":".\n --With समा सम्-आ,\n 1. To begin, "},{"t":"cite","s":"Rām. 1, 45, 13","q":"Rām"},{"t":"txt","s":", to undertake, "},{"t":"cite","s":"Hit. 44, 6","q":"Hit"},{"t":"txt","s":", M."},{"t":"cite","s":"M.\n 2","q":"M.\n"},{"t":"txt","s":". To try, "},{"t":"cite","s":"MBh. 1, 2238.\n 3","q":"MBh"},{"t":"txt","s":". To treat, "},{"t":"cite","s":"MBh. 3, 16298","q":"MBh"},{"t":"txt","s":".\n --With परि परि, To embrace, Vikr. d. 147; "},{"t":"cite","s":"MBh. 4, 514","q":"MBh"},{"t":"txt","s":". Desider. परि रिप्स, To desire to embrace, "},{"t":"cite","s":"Ragh. 13, 32","q":"Ragh"},{"t":"txt","s":" (Calc.).\n --With सम् सम्, संरब्ध,\n 1. Exasperated, enraged, "},{"t":"cite","s":"Rām. 2, 55, 30.\n 2","q":"Rām"},{"t":"txt","s":". Agitated, overwhelmed, "},{"t":"cite","s":"Nal. 13, 14","q":"Nal"},{"t":"txt","s":".\n --Comp.\n --With अभिसम् अभि-सम्, अभिसंरब्ध, Enraged, "},{"t":"cite","s":"Rām. 6, 3, 17","q":"Rām"},{"t":"txt","s":".\n --Cf. Lat. rabies, robur (labor, see लभ्); probably ῥωβίδας, ῥώννυμι; Goth. arbaiths; A.S. earfedh, earfodh; Goth. liban; A.S. leofian, lifian, lybban; O.H.G. laba, labôn; perhaps A.S. a-refian, To bear, a-raefnan, To take away."}]}]}],"raBas":[{"id":"raBas","headword":"रभस्","headword_slp1":"raBas","senses_r":[{"n":1,"spans":[{"t":"txt","s":"रभ् + अस्, n. ved.\n 1. Zeal (in रभस् + वन्त्, zealous, Rigv. i. 9, 6).\n 2. Strength, strengthening food, sacrifice, Rigv. i. 145, 3. See रभ्."}]}]}],"raBasa":[{"id":"raBasa","headword":"रभस","headword_slp1":"raBasa","senses_r":[{"n":1,"spans":[{"t":"txt","s":"रभस् + अ,\n I. adj. Joyful, "},{"t":"cite","s":"Kir. 5, 1","q":"Kir"},{"t":"txt","s":".\n II. m.\n 1. "},{"t":"cite","s":"Joy.\n 2","q":"Joy.\n"},{"t":"txt","s":". Passion, rage, Daśak. in "},{"t":"cite","s":"Chr. 194, 8.\n 3","q":"Chr"},{"t":"txt","s":". Speed, velocity, Śiś. 9, 72; abl. quickly, "},{"t":"cite","s":"Rājat. 5, 190.\n 4","q":"Rājat"},{"t":"txt","s":". Precipitation, Böhtl. Ind. "},{"t":"cite","s":"Spr. 315.\n 5","q":"Spr"},{"t":"txt","s":". Regret, sorrow.\n --Comp."}]}]}],"raBasya":[{"id":"rABasya","headword":"राभस्य","headword_slp1":"rABasya","senses_r":[{"n":1,"spans":[{"t":"txt","s":"राभस्य, i. e. रभस + अ, n. The state or condition of velocity, or of joy."}]}]}]}